       "</style><body><div id=\"sk-container-id-3\" class=\"sk-top-container\"><div class=\"sk-text-repr-fallback\"><pre>RandomizedSearchCV(estimator=ElasticNet(max_iter=2000), n_iter=50, n_jobs=-1,\n",
